WEBVTT

00:07.902 --> 00:13.662
Let's laugh and cry.
chanto waraimasho, nakimasho

00:14.162 --> 00:19.752
We need to fill up our hearts.
kokoro no nakami wo juujitsu sasenakuccha
Subs originally by Froth-Bite
Manually retyped by #Retrofit@IRC.Rizon.Net
Raws by Darkside-Raws

00:19.792 --> 00:28.342
Making matching memories with you...
anata to osoroi no omoide tsukuruno ga

00:28.342 --> 00:30.212
...is important.
daiji daiji

00:31.592 --> 00:34.142
Sometimes I become...
sunao ni narenakattari

00:34.472 --> 00:37.972
...almost dishonest and mean
ijiwaru shichaisouna hi aruno

00:39.472 --> 00:40.812
That's because...
sore wa...

00:42.812 --> 00:45.562
I love you and adore you,
daisuki de taisetsu de

00:45.692 --> 00:48.902
and I don't want to be apart from you.
hanaretaku nai sei nano nante

00:50.862 --> 00:51.862
That's the truth.
henne

00:54.412 --> 01:01.122
I just want to cuddle...
hontou wa itsumo nuku nuku shitetai

01:01.452 --> 01:03.462
...with you.
futaride

01:04.462 --> 01:10.172
So let's laugh and cry.
dakara waraimashou, nakimashou

01:10.842 --> 01:16.262
We need to keep our hearts warm.
kokoro no ondo wo atatame awanakucha

01:16.472 --> 01:24.772
The fate that made us meet...
anata to deaeta unmei ho subetega

01:24.772 --> 01:26.602
...is important.
daiji daiji

01:35.472 --> 01:37.722
So hot...

01:37.722 --> 01:43.222
Momono-san, it'll only get hotter if you say it's hot.

01:51.192 --> 01:54.322
I want to eat cold pudding.

01:57.202 --> 01:59.952
Cold yokan...
(Note: Yokan is a sweet jelly made from bean jam.)

02:05.332 --> 02:09.332
Um, Kozue-chan, those are mine.

02:10.212 --> 02:13.762
You said you were done with your laundry earlier, so...

02:13.762 --> 02:15.422
You're right!

02:15.422 --> 02:15.922
I'm sorry.

02:16.012 --> 02:16.512
I'm sorry.

02:16.592 --> 02:17.052
I'm sorry.

02:17.132 --> 02:17.762
I'm sorry.

02:18.092 --> 02:21.722
Heat-fatigued Kozue-chan is lovely, too.

02:21.722 --> 02:24.892
That's fine, but isn't there something more important?

02:24.892 --> 02:26.352
You mean the air conditioner?

02:26.352 --> 02:28.192
No.

02:28.192 --> 02:30.812
A summer vacation for Narutakisou.

02:33.272 --> 02:37.782
<b>Swimsuits!
Summer!
The Beach!</b>

02:46.502 --> 02:48.162
Mom, it's the ocean!

02:48.162 --> 02:49.332
See!

02:49.332 --> 02:50.332
Yes, it is.

02:50.632 --> 02:52.042
It's so big.

02:52.592 --> 02:54.132
Yes, it's big.

03:00.262 --> 03:01.552
It's the ocean...

03:02.852 --> 03:05.142
Mom, we're not there yet.

03:05.522 --> 03:07.182
You've got it easy.

03:07.182 --> 03:10.562
Why am I stuck being the driver?

03:10.562 --> 03:13.192
We'll split the car rental fee.

03:13.522 --> 03:16.532
But I didn't expect to be able to go to the beach.

03:16.532 --> 03:22.322
We always went to the public pool for our swimming party every year.

03:22.622 --> 03:23.782
Oh?

03:23.782 --> 03:27.372
Have you all forgotten about me having a driver's license?

03:27.372 --> 03:27.662
(Note: Shiratori wears a shirt with kanji on it
in this episode, it reads Suiriku Ryouyou
- Good on both land and water. It
indicates that he's an amphibian.)

03:27.662 --> 03:28.502
No.
(Note: Shiratori wears a shirt with kanji on it
in this episode, it reads Suiriku Ryouyou
- Good on both land and water. It
indicates that he's an amphibian.)

03:28.502 --> 03:30.332
(Note: Shiratori wears a shirt with kanji on it
in this episode, it reads Suiriku Ryouyou
- Good on both land and water. It
indicates that he's an amphibian.)
Thank you, Momono-san!

03:30.332 --> 03:31.622
(Note: Shiratori wears a shirt with kanji on it
in this episode, it reads Suiriku Ryouyou
- Good on both land and water. It
indicates that he's an amphibian.)
It's my first time going to the beach!

03:31.622 --> 03:32.922
It's my first time going to the beach!
(Note: You will see that it's the most
ironic thing in this episode.
We will let you figure out
the answer on your own...)

03:32.922 --> 03:34.842
(Note: You will see that it's the most
ironic thing in this episode.
We will let you figure out
the answer on your own...)
Are you happy, Asami-chan?

03:34.842 --> 03:35.592
(Note: You will see that it's the most
ironic thing in this episode.
We will let you figure out
the answer on your own...)
Yeah!

03:35.882 --> 03:37.342
Your first time?

03:37.342 --> 03:39.722
That's good.

03:39.722 --> 03:42.802
That's provocative coming from you, Momo-san.

03:42.802 --> 03:43.432
What?!

03:43.852 --> 03:45.642
Who's perverted?!

03:45.642 --> 03:46.312
I didn't say that.

03:46.312 --> 03:48.392
Don't talk to me like that!
I didn't say that.

03:48.392 --> 03:50.232
Don't talk to me like that!
Watch where you're going!

03:50.232 --> 03:51.102
Don't talk to me like that!
Please watch the road!

03:51.102 --> 03:52.652
Please watch the road!

03:53.062 --> 03:54.272
Come on.

03:54.272 --> 03:56.442
You're the only one who can drive.

03:56.442 --> 03:59.492
Since it's a rental, it'll be expensive if you wreck it.

04:00.402 --> 04:02.702
I'm innocent!

04:03.822 --> 04:05.952
What do you think that is, Mom?

04:07.702 --> 04:10.122
Lovers' Cape?

04:10.122 --> 04:11.542
Cape...

04:16.382 --> 04:21.302
Lovers' Cape

04:23.762 --> 04:25.262
Let's see...

04:25.262 --> 04:28.102
It's been said that their love will last forever.

04:28.102 --> 04:31.272
If a couple visits Lovers' Cape together...

04:31.732 --> 04:35.352
Then maybe there isn't a reason for us to go there.

04:35.352 --> 04:36.942
Me and my daughter...

04:36.942 --> 04:37.982
True.

04:38.272 --> 04:41.572
But I'm sure the scenery will be great.

04:41.572 --> 04:43.742
That alone should be worth a visit.

04:43.742 --> 04:44.952
You're right.

04:45.362 --> 04:48.202
Hey, don't worry.

04:48.202 --> 04:53.252
We offer quite a service for those of you enjoying the single life too.

04:55.462 --> 04:58.542
If you are single, go to the end of the cape,

04:58.542 --> 05:00.592
and yell your wish.

05:00.592 --> 05:03.472
Then your feelings will reach the person you are thinking of.

05:04.302 --> 05:05.642
Or not.

05:07.142 --> 05:08.762
Seriously?

05:08.762 --> 05:10.392
That's what it says!

05:10.812 --> 05:13.272
What an ambiguous description...

05:13.272 --> 05:15.392
Sounds iffy.

05:15.392 --> 05:18.862
But since we're here, let's go.

05:18.862 --> 05:19.942
Yes.

05:19.942 --> 05:21.532
Let's go!

05:21.532 --> 05:22.652
Yay!

05:37.462 --> 05:38.632
Wow!

05:38.632 --> 05:41.212
It sure is a great view.

05:41.502 --> 05:46.052
That yelling deal might just be true...

05:46.052 --> 05:48.182
In a place like this.

05:48.182 --> 05:50.012
That's true.

05:50.012 --> 05:50.722
Yes.

05:51.312 --> 05:53.932
So, what do I need to do?

05:53.932 --> 05:57.692
Well, "Just put your hands on the monument, and yell."

05:57.692 --> 05:58.942
That's straight forward.

05:59.272 --> 06:01.612
Then I'll go first.

06:03.612 --> 06:08.362
Shiratori-kun, you idiot!

06:11.622 --> 06:17.922
Shiratori-san, you moron!

06:19.752 --> 06:20.792
So?

06:20.792 --> 06:22.842
Did that reach your heart?

06:23.712 --> 06:26.512
Yes, very clearly.

06:26.512 --> 06:28.132
I heard you.

06:28.132 --> 06:30.762
You're no fun.

06:30.762 --> 06:32.142
What a disappointment.

06:32.142 --> 06:33.642
We'll just head back now.

06:35.932 --> 06:40.272
I want to eat stir fry with meat in it!

06:42.442 --> 06:44.862
Extra large!

06:46.282 --> 06:49.952
Is it true that you can catch tuna in this lake?!

06:50.532 --> 06:52.452
Why don't you try it too, Kozue-chan?

06:52.452 --> 06:54.332
Er... sure.

06:55.492 --> 07:00.292
Then your feelings will reach the person you are thinking of...

07:00.292 --> 07:02.542
Who would she think of?

07:03.342 --> 07:04.672
I want...

07:04.672 --> 07:06.212
Everyone!

07:06.212 --> 07:09.092
Come back to the parking lot when you're done!

07:09.092 --> 07:11.392
Or else, we'll leave you behind!

07:12.932 --> 07:15.142
Actually, we'll get going now!

07:16.102 --> 07:18.062
Let's go, Shiratori-san.

07:18.852 --> 07:21.272
But you were about to say something.

07:21.852 --> 07:22.772
It's okay.

07:25.482 --> 07:28.402
Actually, we'd better hurry to the beach.

07:28.402 --> 07:29.492
Kozue-chan...

07:30.112 --> 07:33.992
We'd better hurry before summer vacation is over.

07:43.082 --> 07:44.292
The blue sky!

07:45.462 --> 07:46.842
The white clouds!

07:47.762 --> 07:49.262
The hot beach!

07:49.842 --> 07:52.842
The rushing waves and the swimmers!

07:53.222 --> 07:56.312
The beach houses, producing the yummy smell of grilled squid!

07:56.972 --> 07:58.852
The swimming gals!

08:01.352 --> 08:02.942
Awright!

08:03.562 --> 08:06.732
My friends, let me tell you.

08:06.732 --> 08:09.362
The real meaning of summer is swimming at the beach!

08:09.862 --> 08:13.662
My dear ocean, I am back!

08:19.252 --> 08:22.252
Then let's get changed.

08:22.252 --> 08:24.752
Wait, out here?

08:27.422 --> 08:28.462
Huh?

08:28.462 --> 08:31.762
We're not using the beach house or locker rooms?

08:32.222 --> 08:34.092
Oh, come on.

08:34.092 --> 08:36.762
Everyone is wearing swimsuits under their clothes.

08:43.022 --> 08:45.022
Please don't watch.

08:50.782 --> 08:52.822
That might be true.

08:52.822 --> 08:54.912
Sure, you already have swimsuits on.

08:54.912 --> 08:56.822
But to see women undress...

08:56.822 --> 08:57.832
I can tell exactly what you're thinking.
But to see women undress...

08:57.832 --> 08:59.662
I can tell exactly what you're thinking.

09:05.332 --> 09:08.672
Everyone is ready!

09:09.172 --> 09:11.342
Now, bored-looking Shiratori-kun,

09:11.342 --> 09:13.012
Yes?

09:13.802 --> 09:16.012
I have a task for you.

09:23.432 --> 09:26.562
I feel like royalty!

09:26.562 --> 09:27.812
Really?

09:27.812 --> 09:31.362
You don't have to be that disappointed.

09:32.482 --> 09:34.572
But I'm not...

09:34.862 --> 09:37.702
That's because you're having the wrong thoughts.

09:37.702 --> 09:39.952
I'm not!

09:39.952 --> 09:42.952
You want to put the lotion on someone else, right?

09:42.952 --> 09:44.542
No...

09:45.002 --> 09:47.622
Kozue Onee-chan, don't you need some lotion?

09:47.622 --> 09:51.002
I put it on before we left.

09:55.592 --> 09:58.092
I can tell what you're thinking.

09:59.052 --> 10:01.512
Um, Shiratori-san,

10:02.392 --> 10:05.432
would you like to go in the water with me when you're done?

10:06.982 --> 10:12.822
But I.. um... can't swim, so I can only go in the shallow water.

10:13.902 --> 10:15.442
Can't swim?

10:16.742 --> 10:18.822
Are you plotting something again?!

10:18.822 --> 10:20.122
No, no.

10:20.532 --> 10:23.122
Then I have something for you.

10:24.122 --> 10:26.622
It should be in here...

10:26.622 --> 10:28.712
There it is!

10:28.712 --> 10:30.132
Use this if you'd like.

10:33.212 --> 10:34.672
Yay.

10:34.672 --> 10:36.172
Thank you.

10:36.172 --> 10:38.432
I'll be so safe with this.

10:38.432 --> 10:39.092
Yes!

10:39.092 --> 10:40.892
It's really cute!

10:40.892 --> 10:42.802
It looks good on you.

11:03.152 --> 11:05.742
I love being in the sea.

11:05.742 --> 11:08.912
Momono-san, are you enjoying yourself?

11:09.452 --> 11:10.532
Oh yeah.

11:10.532 --> 11:12.742
Are you enjoying yourself, too?

11:12.742 --> 11:13.742
Yes.

11:13.742 --> 11:15.662
Oh, Shiratori-kun too...

11:17.662 --> 11:20.582
Yay...

11:21.632 --> 11:23.252
Oh, wow!

11:23.252 --> 11:25.052
That looks great!

11:25.052 --> 11:27.672
Shiratori... so a swan, huh?

11:27.672 --> 11:29.552
Man, that's nice...

11:30.592 --> 11:33.102
Oh, excuse me.

11:37.432 --> 11:38.942
Damn it, Tama-kichi!

11:38.942 --> 11:40.352
What the heck was that for?!

11:40.902 --> 11:43.362
It wasn't intentional.

11:43.862 --> 11:45.612
Excuse me.

11:45.612 --> 11:46.442
The waves are pushing me.

11:46.442 --> 11:47.532
She's doing it to everyone...
The waves are pushing me.

11:47.532 --> 11:48.782
She's doing it to everyone...
You'd better get out of my way.

11:48.782 --> 11:50.072
You'd better get out of my way.

11:53.282 --> 11:55.122
Hey, everyone,

11:55.952 --> 11:58.752
let's play with the ball.

11:58.752 --> 12:00.962
Are you drowning, Asami-chan?

12:15.602 --> 12:18.682
It's nice to be young. Right, Haibara?

12:19.942 --> 12:24.152
When did we lose our youth?

12:24.772 --> 12:27.282
How sad to be old.

12:27.282 --> 12:29.902
It's nice to be young, Haibara.

12:29.902 --> 12:31.992
Who is he talking to?

12:47.802 --> 12:48.882
Thank you.

12:54.222 --> 12:56.392
Oh, Mom!

13:01.982 --> 13:04.312
Do you want to play with us too?

13:05.522 --> 13:07.692
What are you doing, Mom?

13:08.612 --> 13:10.532
Asami, look.

13:13.452 --> 13:14.362
It's a castle.

13:14.362 --> 13:16.492
That's cool!

13:23.212 --> 13:25.082
Mom!

13:25.172 --> 13:26.592
Mom!

13:35.222 --> 13:37.722
Oh no! We've got a problem!

13:38.182 --> 13:39.262
Stand by!

13:39.262 --> 13:40.772
Go!

13:47.022 --> 13:48.612
Sheesh.

13:49.902 --> 13:52.402
Please be careful.

13:52.862 --> 13:55.072
We're sorry.

13:55.072 --> 13:59.122
I'll get fired again if there are any accidents.

13:59.122 --> 14:01.242
It'll hurt more than the bump on my head.

14:01.622 --> 14:02.832
Um...

14:03.582 --> 14:05.502
We've met before, haven't we?

14:05.792 --> 14:06.582
Yo?

14:07.252 --> 14:09.212
What are you talking about?

14:09.212 --> 14:10.502
We definitely have.

14:11.212 --> 14:13.092
Oh, boy.

14:13.842 --> 14:16.802
Anyway, I'm glad you are safe.

14:18.052 --> 14:19.892
The ocean is so incredible.

14:19.892 --> 14:21.182
The castle...

14:21.182 --> 14:22.772
My castle...

14:22.772 --> 14:24.732
What castle?

14:25.392 --> 14:26.392
I don't know...

14:27.022 --> 14:28.942
Well, let's forget about that,

14:28.942 --> 14:32.732
and move on to today's secret event.

14:32.732 --> 14:33.862
Tada!

14:33.862 --> 14:36.782
Get out the deluxe watermelon!

14:38.282 --> 14:40.782
And the wooden blade!

14:41.992 --> 14:43.622
Why in English?

14:43.622 --> 14:44.582
A watermelon?

14:44.582 --> 14:47.672
Okay, funny girl, come on!

14:48.542 --> 14:51.002
Set up the deluxe watermelon!

14:51.382 --> 14:53.342
Are you ready, okay?

14:53.962 --> 14:54.512
Yeah.

14:54.972 --> 14:56.762
Set the blindfold!

14:57.512 --> 14:58.722
It's dark.

14:59.342 --> 15:00.682
Tama-kichi,

15:00.682 --> 15:02.892
Japanese sash stand by!

15:02.892 --> 15:03.972
Oh, yeah.

15:03.972 --> 15:05.562
What are you doing?

15:05.562 --> 15:07.102
She's set!

15:09.022 --> 15:10.022
Three.

15:10.022 --> 15:10.942
Two.

15:10.942 --> 15:11.822
One.

15:11.822 --> 15:13.652
Operation!

15:27.542 --> 15:32.132
Man, maybe that was a bit harsh for Asami-chan.

15:32.132 --> 15:34.462
Momo-san, you always go overboard.

15:34.882 --> 15:35.962
Oh well.

15:35.962 --> 15:38.012
Then next up... Tama-kichi!

15:38.012 --> 15:39.682
Yes.

15:43.932 --> 15:45.432
Ready?

15:45.432 --> 15:46.472
Yes.

15:47.522 --> 15:49.102
Operation!

15:54.732 --> 15:55.482
Good.

15:55.482 --> 15:56.192
Go right. Right.

15:56.192 --> 15:56.942
No, left!

15:56.942 --> 15:57.492
Go left.

15:57.492 --> 15:58.452
Go right.

15:58.452 --> 15:59.492
Not there!

16:06.082 --> 16:09.462
I slashed another worthless object.

16:10.672 --> 16:13.502
Seriously, who are you?

16:16.502 --> 16:18.052
Here, have half of mine.

16:18.052 --> 16:19.222
Thanks.

16:25.932 --> 16:27.182
It's a watermelon!

16:27.772 --> 16:29.732
Onii-chan, it's a watermelon!

16:29.732 --> 16:30.772
A watermelon!

16:30.772 --> 16:32.352
I'm happy for you, Asami-chan.

16:32.652 --> 16:34.612
Is it good?

16:34.612 --> 16:35.362
Yeah!

16:35.982 --> 16:37.652
It's so sweet!

16:50.002 --> 16:52.082
I'm sorry!

16:58.512 --> 17:00.262
Um, may I...

17:06.222 --> 17:09.562
Now that we're full...

17:09.892 --> 17:14.442
The 46th Annual Narutakisou Long Distance Swim Contest will commence!

17:14.982 --> 17:17.232
She's so energetic...

17:17.902 --> 17:19.692
The goal is that island!

17:20.282 --> 17:23.362
The winner will become a legendary hero!

17:23.362 --> 17:26.282
I don't care to be one...

17:26.282 --> 17:29.292
After me, gang!

17:32.502 --> 17:34.252
Not you!

17:37.712 --> 17:39.752
Oh? I wonder what's wrong?

17:49.932 --> 17:52.142
May I sit here?

17:52.142 --> 17:53.312
Sure.

17:58.692 --> 18:01.732
Why didn't you go?

18:03.992 --> 18:07.992
I thought I'd rest a little more before going back in.

18:07.992 --> 18:09.452
Really?

18:09.452 --> 18:12.662
Then I'll rest up too.

18:12.912 --> 18:17.632
Because I don't want to be tired when you go swimming.

18:18.252 --> 18:19.632
Kozue-chan...

18:20.212 --> 18:22.012
Um, Kozue-chan,

18:22.632 --> 18:25.722
when we stopped by that cape on our way here...

18:25.722 --> 18:26.842
Yes.

18:26.842 --> 18:29.392
The scenery was beautiful.

18:29.392 --> 18:31.392
I'm sure the sunset will be beautiful too.

18:32.022 --> 18:34.982
Oh, it might be a good idea to stop by on our way home, too.

18:36.892 --> 18:38.402
I look forward to it.

18:39.022 --> 18:40.522
Yeah!

18:40.522 --> 18:43.402
I'm now the legendary hero...

18:44.152 --> 18:46.612
OK, I'm first.

18:46.612 --> 18:48.452
Hey! Tama-kichi!

18:49.782 --> 18:51.372
They're so young.

18:51.372 --> 18:52.372
Yes...

18:53.122 --> 18:57.372
You are so sly and violent.

18:57.372 --> 18:59.632
By the way, where is Asami-chan?

19:02.552 --> 19:02.842
I'm coming! I won't let you drown!

19:02.842 --> 19:06.422
You were about to say something back there.
I'm coming! I won't let you drown!

19:06.422 --> 19:07.432
I'm coming! I won't let you drown!
Yes.

19:07.432 --> 19:08.052
It was...

19:10.182 --> 19:11.012
I'll tell you later.

19:16.892 --> 19:19.902
Don't play so recklessly!

19:21.442 --> 19:23.402
Good catch! Good catch!

19:23.822 --> 19:28.202
Tamami-chan caught all of them on our way back.

19:28.202 --> 19:29.862
How did you catch so many?

19:30.662 --> 19:33.532
Let's barbeque!

19:33.532 --> 19:34.912
Fish...

19:38.212 --> 19:41.252
Party on the beach!

19:42.632 --> 19:43.752
Stop it!

19:47.592 --> 19:50.302
Whirlpool!

19:54.182 --> 19:55.972
How many times do I need to tell you?!

19:55.972 --> 19:57.312
We are sorry.
How many times do I need to tell you?!

19:57.312 --> 19:57.852
We are sorry.

20:05.822 --> 20:07.692
Something to go with beer...

20:08.322 --> 20:10.822
Romance Wish
I want a girlfriend
Johnny & Haibara

20:27.262 --> 20:30.052
You gave me a wonderful summer vacation.

20:30.592 --> 20:32.932
Thank you, Shiratori-san.

20:34.182 --> 20:36.722
I didn't do anything.

20:38.222 --> 20:39.732
Isn't it pretty?

20:41.352 --> 20:42.192
Yeah.

20:59.202 --> 21:03.672
I'm really glad that I met everyone.

21:19.772 --> 21:21.272
Hey!

21:21.272 --> 21:23.562
We're leaving!

21:25.192 --> 21:27.062
Let's go, Kozue-chan.

21:29.902 --> 21:31.032
Everyone is waiting.

21:34.032 --> 21:35.032
Yes.

21:49.392 --> 21:55.902
One day, I drew a picture all over a canvas,
itsu no hika canvas ni e ippai

21:55.982 --> 22:01.702
a picture of 7-colored dreams.
nanairo no yume egaita

22:03.122 --> 22:09.582
When I noticed, I was a bit more grown up.
ki ga tsukeba sukoshi otona ni natte

22:09.832 --> 22:14.882
What have I found?
nani wo mitsuketandarou

22:16.842 --> 22:23.592
In this aimless daily life,
yuka ate no nai mainichi no nakade

22:23.842 --> 22:29.522
I found something that's most important.
ichiban taisetsuna koto ni kizuita

22:30.522 --> 22:36.362
Yes, it's always all right,
donna tokidemo sousa daijoubu

22:36.362 --> 22:38.612
because you are here.
kimi ga irukara

22:38.822 --> 22:44.992
Holding these unforgettable thoughts,
wasurenai kono omoi dakishimete

22:45.492 --> 22:51.332
I will start walking the path of the halted fantasy again,
mouichido togireta yume no fantasy

22:51.332 --> 22:55.962
at my own speed.
aruitemiyou boku no speed de

